      "text": "[6:21PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from the 3rd Mainland Bridge, inward Adeniji Adele Road, through Oba's Palace and Police Post.\nSlow movement from Idumota underneath the bridge, inward Eyin Eyo, connecting Balogun Street, attributed to market activities in the area.\nBusy traffic conditions from Tinubu Square, connecting Carter Bridge via Tom Jones Intersection, due to the evening return journey rush.\nExpected traffic movement on Ilubinrin, ascending Carter Bridge, inward Ijora Olopa, as well as Oyingbo.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
